316-Execution records are server-owned and never accepted back as workflow definitions. Node map
317-keys must equal node IDs in the stored snapshot. `attempts` is a non-negative integer;
318-`duration_ms` is null until terminal and otherwise non-negative; `artifact_refs` are normalized
319-relative paths beneath approved output roots; logs are capped by count and bytes; and all
320-free-text/log/error fields pass through redaction before persistence and SSE emission. Overall
321-and node status transitions are monotonic according to the scheduler state machine; terminal
